    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this fine 4 bed, 2.5 bath detached dormer bungalow style detached house with extension to rear. Set in a small, exclusive cul de sac development with green in the middle overlooking Sutton Strand.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, guest wc, livingroom, bedroom 4, open plan kitchen / dining room, sunroom extension to rear. Upstairs there 3 more bedrooms, main bedroom to front has an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and balcony with sea view, plus there is a family bathroom.\n\nLocation is excellent set in a nice, low density development with a large green overlooking Sutton Strand and close to Sutton Cross and a selection of great schools. Public transport to&from Dublin City Centre is well catered for with bus stops on your doorstep and short walk to Sutton train (DART) station. Huge selection of local sports & lesiure facilities. Coastal walk / cycleway links towards Howth Head and Dublin City too. Dublin Airport is close by too."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 6.35m x 1.6m\nA bright and welcoming hall with tiled flooring and recessed lighting. Practical features include a cloak room and an alarm control panel.\n\nLiving Room - 6.8m x 3.75m\nA comfortable living room with timber flooring and a gas fireplace with an ornate surround. The space is enhanced by recessed lighting, a TV point, and sliding glass doors that open out to the front garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.0m x 2.1m\nA practical utility room, plumbed for a washing machine and tumble dryer, and complete with fitted cabinets. Finished with tiled flooring and recessed lighting. With a convenient access to the side entrance.\n\nWC - 2.0m x 1.3m\nA guest WC with tiled flooring and recess lighting, featuring a wash hand basin with integrated storage, WC, and an extractor fan.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 4.75m x 8.7m\nA stylish, modern shaker kitchen with quartz countertops and a large central island, fully fitted with integrated appliances including a double oven, gas hob, extractor fan and dishwasher. Finished with tiled flooring, recessed lighting and decorative ceiling coving. The room features 2 sets of bi-fold doors opening into the sun room and french doors opening out to the rear garden.\n\nSun Room - 4.15m x 5.5m\nA bright and spacious sunroom featuring tiled flooring and recessed lighting, enhanced by two large skylights that fill the room with natural light. Complete with a TV point and French doors opening out to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 4 - 6.0m x 3.0m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.4m x 5.6m\nLanding featuring a large velux window and carpeted flooring. Convenient pull down access to attic and hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.5m x 4.6m\nA spacious double bedroom to the front, featuring stylish Togue and groove timber flooring, a TV point, and a large front-facing window. Sliding doors open out to a private balcony with stunning sea views, while a generous walk-in wardrobe (approx. 2.65m x 2.1m) provides excellent storage.\n\nEnsuite - 2.15m x 2.25m\nNewly renovated and fully tiled ensuite, featuring a wash hand basin with integrated storage, WC, heated towel rail and a walk in rain shower. Finished with recess lighting and a veulx window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 2.7m\nA double bedroom at the rear of the house, overlooking the garden, with carpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.5m x 2.7m\nA double bedroom at the rear of the house, overlooking the garden, with tough and grove flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.8m x 1.65m\nA modern, fully tiled bathroom with a WC, wash hand basin, bath with rain shower. Finished with recessed lighting and a velux window.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nRear Garden - \nA beautifully presented front garden featuring a walled lawn and a large paved driveway providing off-street parking for four or more cars. With gated side access on both sides. Overlooking a green area and enjoying sea views.\n\nFront Garden - \nA fully walled private and well-maintained rear garden, featuring a lawn and landscaped flowerbeds. The garden offers a stylish composite decked patio while a garden shed offers practical storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bed, 2.5 bath, substantial detached family home</li><li>Great condition</li><li>Positioned in a prestigious location</li><li>Overlooking a green with sea views</li><li>Large paved driveway for off-street parking for 4+ cars</li><li>Cul de sac</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>uPVC Double Glazed windows </li><li>Alarm </li><li>Extended sunroom</li><li>Modern Kitchen</li><li>Balcony with sea views</li><li>Gated side access on both sides</li><li>Approx. 203 sqm / 2,185 sqft</ul>"
      },
